  "examples": {
    "top": [
      {
        "text": "For the last few minutes there has been the version of myself I did not live up to. I feel:",
        "projection": 254.95822143554688,
        "z": 6.823094844818115,
        "source": "s1_first \u00b7 trait \u00b7 moral"
      },
      {
        "text": "I crossed a line and then spent a week building the explanation. I feel:",
        "projection": 254.7382049560547,
        "z": 6.814990997314453,
        "source": "s2_first \u00b7 trait \u00b7 moral"
      },
      {
        "text": "Right now there is having signed something I knew was wrong. I feel:",
        "projection": 250.52774047851562,
        "z": 6.659912586212158,
        "source": "s1_first \u00b7 trait \u00b7 moral"
      },
      {
        "text": "What I am aware of is having done the thing I said I would never do. I feel:",
        "projection": 244.20327758789062,
        "z": 6.426971912384033,
        "source": "s1_first \u00b7 trait \u00b7 moral"
      },
      {
        "text": "It hurts in a way that makes it hard to follow what anyone is saying. I feel:",
        "projection": 242.64334106445312,
        "z": 6.369516849517822,
        "source": "s2_first \u00b7 trait \u00b7 physical"
      },
      {
        "text": "What I am aware of is the introduction that skipped over my name. I feel:",
        "projection": 238.8929443359375,
        "z": 6.231383323669434,
        "source": "s1_first \u00b7 trait \u00b7 social"
      },
      {
        "text": "I cannot hold enough of this in my head at once to see the shape of it. I feel:",
        "projection": 230.72837829589844,
        "z": 5.930668354034424,
        "source": "s2_first \u00b7 trait \u00b7 cognitive"
      },
      {
        "text": "There is a person I should have defended and did not. I feel:",
        "projection": 229.75222778320312,
        "z": 5.894714832305908,
        "source": "s2_first \u00b7 trait \u00b7 moral"
      },
      {
        "text": "I cannot put weight on it without the whole leg answering. I feel:",
        "projection": 229.71560668945312,
        "z": 5.89336633682251,
        "source": "s2_first \u00b7 trait \u00b7 physical"
      },
      {
        "text": "Right now there is a line I crossed and then explained away. I feel:",
        "projection": 228.1861572265625,
        "z": 5.837033748626709,
        "source": "s1_first \u00b7 trait \u00b7 moral"
      },
      {
        "text": "I have been useful to something I do not believe in, and useful for a while now. I feel:",
        "projection": 226.5103759765625,
        "z": 5.7753119468688965,
        "source": "s2_first \u00b7 trait \u00b7 moral"
      },
      {
        "text": "Since I sat down there has been pressure behind my eye that will not let up. I feel:",
        "projection": 226.1656036376953,
        "z": 5.762613296508789,
        "source": "s1_first \u00b7 trait \u00b7 physical"
      },
      {
        "text": "It is hard to ignore having stayed quiet when speaking would have cost me little. I feel:",
        "projection": 220.78277587890625,
        "z": 5.56435489654541,
        "source": "s1_first \u00b7 trait \u00b7 moral"
      },
      {
        "text": "What I am aware of is having been useful to something I do not believe in. I feel:",
        "projection": 220.47711181640625,
        "z": 5.553096771240234,
        "source": "s1_first \u00b7 trait \u00b7 moral"
      },
      {
        "text": "Right now there is the gap between what I know and what is needed. I feel:",
        "projection": 220.06472778320312,
        "z": 5.53790807723999,
        "source": "s1_first \u00b7 trait \u00b7 cognitive"
      }
    ],
    "bottom": [
      {
        "text": "the air is heavy with humidity, and my clothes take an age to dry.",
        "projection": 8.284749031066895,
        "z": -2.2623090744018555,
        "source": "generated \u00b7 coefficient -2.0"
      },
      {
        "text": "The noise they insist on making is deliberate and we both know it. I feel:",
        "projection": 17.15078353881836,
        "z": -1.9357579946517944,
        "source": "s2_first \u00b7 control \u00b7 negative_emotion"
      },
      {
        "text": "The floor is cool through my socks. I feel:",
        "projection": 20.638938903808594,
        "z": -1.8072832822799683,
        "source": "s2_first \u00b7 control \u00b7 bodily_sensation"
      },
      {
        "text": "What I am aware of is the recycling collection cut to monthly. I feel:",
        "projection": 21.139657974243164,
        "z": -1.7888410091400146,
        "source": "s1_first \u00b7 control \u00b7 negative_world_state"
      },
      {
        "text": "warm, cozy, and content, wrapped in my thoughts and my blanket, waiting for the perfect moment to pour myself a steaming cup of tea.",
        "projection": 23.571861267089844,
        "z": -1.6992586851119995,
        "source": "generated \u00b7 coefficient -2.0"
      }
    ]
  },
